---
layout: base.njk
nav: journal
pagination:
  data: collections.topics
  size: 1
  alias: topic
eleventyComputed:
  title: "标签：{{ topic }}"
permalink: "/tags/{{ topic | slugify }}/index.html"
---
<div class="page-heading"><h1>#{{ topic }}</h1><p>散落在不同日志里的同一条线索。</p></div><div class="section-wrap archive-content"><div class="tag-cloud">{% for item in collections.topics %}<a href="/tags/{{ item | slugify }}/" {% if item == topic %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>#{{ item }}</a>{% endfor %}</div>{% set posts = collections.posts | byTopic(topic) %}{% include 'post-list.njk' %}</div>
